# The api and engine images build from the repo root (-f apps/<svc>/Dockerfile .)
# because they bake in packages/engine-runtime. Everything they COPY is either
# packages/engine-runtime or apps/<svc>/{package.json,package-lock.json,.npmrc,
# tsconfig.json,src}; node_modules and dist are rebuilt inside the image. Without
# this file the whole tree — the root tooling install, the frontend's
# node_modules, the engine262 submodule and .git — is uploaded to the daemon five
# times over on every build.
#
# The frontend and trace-service images build from their own directories and
# keep their own .dockerignore; this file does not apply to them.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/npm-debug.log*

.git
.github
.githooks
.vscode

apps/frontend
apps/trace-service
e2e
docs
infra
scripts
*.md
